    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Ella Dunphy are delighted to present this exceptional four bedroom semi-detached home, ideally positioned within the popular Fox Meadows development. Extensively upgraded from the original developer specification, this impressive property combines high-quality finishes, exceptional storage, modern technology and\npractical family living.\n\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, the property offers well-proportioned accommodation over two floors, with underfloor heating throughout the ground floor & premium waterproof SPC rigid-core flooring in a light oak finish throughout. The welcoming entrance hall features decorative wall panelling and leads to a bright living room with bespoke media wall and excellent built-in storage. The impressive open-plan kitchen/dining area is a\nstandout feature, with full-height cabinetry, carousel storage and extensive fitted units. The kitchen includes a premium NEFF N90 appliance suite, including full steam oven, steam-assisted oven, combination microwave, integrated coffee machine, NEFF hob and dishwasher. The adjoining utility room provides an additional sink,\nfitted cabinetry, shelving and full-height storage.\n\nUpstairs are four versatile bedrooms, three with fitted wardrobes. The principal bedroom benefits from a stylish en-suite with rainfall shower, while the main bathroom features a rainfall shower, freestanding bath, upgraded black radiator and heated towel rail. The fourth bedroom offers excellent flexibility as a bedroom, home office, dressing room or walk-in wardrobe.\n\nOutside, the property benefits from a private, not-overlooked rear garden, together with a purpose-built 8ft × 8ft garden office and adjoining 8ft × 6ft storage shed, both with hardwired electricity. The garden office also benefits from Cat 6 connectivity. Further features include Cat 6 network cabling to key areas, an EV charging\npoint, Ring video doorbell, external electrical sockets, whole-house water filtration and softening system, triple-filtered drinking-water tap and a fully boarded loft providing additional storage.\n\nFox Meadows is a well-established residential development ideally located within easy walking distance of Kilkenny City Centre and a host of local amenities. The development is situated within the St Canice's Parish and is conveniently positioned close to a number of\nwell-regarded schools, including St Canice's National School, Loreto Secondary School and CBS Kilkenny. A range of shops, recreational facilities and sporting amenities are also nearby, while the M9 motorway is easily accessible, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin and Waterford. This beautifully upgraded home offers an excellent combination of space, privacy and modern living, with an outstanding level of specification throughout. \n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nEntrance Hall: Welcoming entrance hall with attractive Premium SPC rigid-core flooring throughout the home, creating a warm and inviting first impression.\n\nLiving Room: Bright and spacious living room with excellent built-in storage, providing a comfortable and practical space for everyday family living.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room: Generous open-plan kitchen and dining area with extensive built-in storage. The kitchen is well-equipped with two built-in ovens, combination microwave oven, coffee machine and integrated hob. The open-plan layout provides an ideal space for both family dining and entertaining.\n\nUtility Room: Practical utility room, additional sink and ample storage, providing valuable additional workspace and keeping the main kitchen area uncluttered.\n\nGuest WC: Complemented by stylish wood-effect wall detailing for a warm and contemporary finish & a classic white WC and wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom 1: Spacious double bedroom and ample built-in\nstorage, offering a comfortable and well-organised bedroom space.\n\nBedroom 2: Large double bedroom, built-in wardrobes,\nproviding generous floor space and excellent storage.\n\nBedroom 3: Further double bedroom, built-in wardrobe space, offering flexibility for family members, guests or a home office.\n\nEn-Suite: Well-appointed en-suite with floor-to-ceiling tiling, a walk-in shower and useful storage beneath the sink.\n\nMain Bathroom: Spacious family bathroom featuring a shower, deep bath, heated towel rail and wash hand basin with additional storage underneath.\n\nBedroom 4: A highly versatile additional room which can be used as a fourth double bedroom, home office, dressing room or spacious walk-in wardrobe depending on the purchaser's needs."
      },
